I am now inside the new office.
It is a large and bright room.
A friendly man stands by the door.
He smiles at me.
"Welcome!" he says.
"My name is Peter."
I shake his hand.
"Hi Peter, my name is Maya," I say.
Peter is a colleague.
We walk together through the office.
"You have a desk here," says Peter.
The desk has number sixteen.
"And you have a computer," he says.
He gives me a new laptop.
I look at my new spot.
I have a chair and a large monitor.
"Thank you very much, Peter," I say.
I am ready for my first workday.
